# This is the public, reviewed mirror of the protected release-tag-trust
# environment variable. release.yml fails if the two normalized signer lists
# differ, then verifies the tag using the protected copy. Verify locally with:
#
#   git -c gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile=.github/allowed-signers verify-tag vX.Y.Z
#
# Format: <principal> [options] <keytype> <key>. See ssh-keygen(1), "ALLOWED
# SIGNERS". Retire a key with valid-before rather than deleting its line: git
# checks the option against the signature timestamp. Rotation steps are in
# docs/operations/releasing.md.

